Package: cutefish-webkit
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Cutefish web engine
 The web engine of the Cutefish desktop: a WebKit port based on WPE WebKit,
 with the curl network backend and Skia rendering into DMA-BUF buffers. It
 holds libcutefish-webkit with WebKit's and JavaScriptCore's C APIs, the web
 and network processes, and the headers and pkg-config file to build against
 it.
